[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_V]
Muffins!

[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_V_desc]
Apparently, knowing only one thing that a pony likes is not enough, but now we know two things that she likes the most.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_V]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_V_desc]
很显然，只知道某只小马最喜欢的一样东西是不够的，但我们现在知道她最喜欢的两样东西了。

